# Pending Program.cs wiring (v0.2.12): field-type upgrades (object→Lock) and
# method body changes that improve lock contention and fix mod SVG icon loss.
# The patches ship in the decompiled donor tree and are validated here, but
# Cecil transplant entries in Program.cs are deferred because ClientWorldMap
# and SystemClientTickingBlocks require ~25 method transplants each (every
# method touching the renamed lock fields). ParticleManager is import-only.
